Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.55,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.29,0:01:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder who this is from.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.97,0:01:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.37,0:01:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.28,0:01:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I really miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.25,0:01:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.73,0:01:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it's been six\Nyears since we've seen each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.21,0:01:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget the day\NMom took me to live with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.01,0:01:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.93,0:01:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.05,0:01:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wee!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.65,0:01:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:02:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sending you this video just so you\Ndon't forget your little sister's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like I'm running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.27,0:02:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping to see\Nyou once more before...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.05,0:02:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.37,0:02:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.73,0:02:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Run out of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.45,0:02:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.75,0:02:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.73,0:02:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.51,0:02:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.51,0:02:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.01,0:02:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.37,0:02:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an invitation to the\Ntournament at Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.33,0:02:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A tournament at Duelist Kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.25,0:02:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that an island?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.47,0:02:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's where Pegasus is\Nkeeping your grandpa. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.07,0:02:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to know for sure\Nis to become a contestant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.99,0:02:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The boat's going to be\Nleaving in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:02:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't go. It\Ncould be dangerous. I have
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.57,0:03:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,to go it's the only\Nclue i have for rescuing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.23,0:03:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,grandpa i still can't\Nbelieve it pegasus used
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.27,0:03:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,some kind of weird spell\Nto grab your grandpa's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.87,0:03:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,soul away and now he's toying with you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.35,0:03:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,forcing you to duel in\Nthe tournament right and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,without invitations we\Ncan't even go there with
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you i wish we could\Nhelp you pal this is bad
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.39,0:03:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.39,0:03:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,According to this card, the tournament\Nwinner takes the grand prize of $3 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,$3 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.35,0:03:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So what, Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.57,0:03:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares about money at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.43,0:03:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.35,0:03:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, $3 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.25,0:03:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess Joey does.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.17,0:03:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,$3 million in cold cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.47,0:03:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, what are you doing up here? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.57,0:03:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.55,0:03:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.67,0:04:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just thinking about\Na whole lot of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.99,0:04:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you do know that I care\Nabout your gramps, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.35,0:04:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, he taught me about\Nthe heart of the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.39,0:04:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.91,0:04:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.31,0:04:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,One way or another, I'll\Nhelp you beat Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.69,0:04:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, that really means a lot to me, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.27,0:04:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.27,0:04:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember the first time we met?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.79,0:04:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.15,0:04:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all because of\Nthe Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The way Grandpa explained it to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.97,0:04:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,the puzzle was originally\Nfound in some Egyptian ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.85,0:04:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My Grandpa gave it to me and\Nkind of dared me to solve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.17,0:04:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the most incredible\Nthing I'd ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I touched it,\NI knew it was special.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a wish on the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.79,0:04:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked it to give me a real friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.27,0:04:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think the puzzle\Ncame through for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.93,0:04:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That was when I met up\Nwith you and Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.45,0:04:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you sure didn't act\Nlike my friends at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.51,0:04:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean when we were playing\Nkeep-away with the Millennium Puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.05,0:04:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It was for you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.73,0:05:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We just wanted to toughen you up so\Nyou could stand up to the real bullies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.99,0:05:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We were only teasing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.31,0:05:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Teasing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.49,0:05:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You took a piece of the Millennium\NPuzzle and threw it out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.87,0:05:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was the one that tried to help you\Nguys out when that bully picked on you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.21,0:05:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a mean one all right
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.93,0:05:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.23,0:05:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.14,0:05:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,look what just showed up its\Nlittle Yugi just in time to watch
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.11,0:05:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,me mop the floor with these\Nguys Get back leave them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.11,0:05:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna stop me a\Nlittle shrimp like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.97,0:05:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you these guys are my friends
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.01,0:05:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.65,0:05:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You jump to the head of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.63,0:05:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Say your prayers, you runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.75,0:06:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You stood up for us, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of you, we got\Nthat moron expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.41,0:06:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And Tristan and I learned what it\Nwas like to have a true friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.05,0:06:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at least you retrieved\Nthe lost puzzle piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.53,0:06:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't done that, I could never\Nhave solved the Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.93,0:06:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to apologize, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.71,0:06:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been acting like a real jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.79,0:06:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, were you acting?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.97,0:06:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I deserve that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.89,0:06:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, I think Tristan\Nand I may have underestimated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.76,0:06:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Yugi, you're a tougher\Nkid than I ever gave you credit for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.83,0:06:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should hang out more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.89,0:06:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.43,0:06:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth of the matter is, you're\Nthe best friend I've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.91,0:06:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.27,0:06:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too bad you can't go with me to\Nrescue Grandpa. Don't worry. Somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.05,0:06:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Some way. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.25,0:06:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Together?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.57,0:07:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a team, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can you go without an invitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.51,0:07:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, all duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to this event sponsored\Nby Industrial Illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You received with your\Ninvitation the starships
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.19,0:07:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,that will grant you\Nentry into the contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.69,0:07:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You are all elite,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.97,0:07:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,invited by us after close observation\Nof your past duel monsters contests.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.25,0:07:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You each have a fair\Nand equal chance to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.35,0:07:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It all comes down to how well you've\Nchosen your cards and how well you play.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.63,0:07:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, duelists, cross the ocean\Nand enter the duelist kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.73,0:07:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Present your star chips\Nas you board the vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.77,0:07:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.61,0:07:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Only official contestants\Nare allowed on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.27,0:07:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know I'm not official?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the official\Nduelists aren't trying
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.25,0:07:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,to sneak on board through\Nthe lower hatches.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.63,0:07:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.77,0:08:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop your struggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to throw you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.85,0:08:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.76,0:08:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to duel and I'm gonna duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.19,0:08:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.67,0:08:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugi. Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.95,0:08:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha, did you really think I'd\Nlet you do this on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.19,0:08:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.91,0:08:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, man, bring it up, bring it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They're distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.81,0:08:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.93,0:08:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.93,0:08:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta let him on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Only people with a star\Nchip can get on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.73,0:08:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no exceptions, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.53,0:08:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But Joey has a star chip.\NDidn't he tell you? I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.81,0:08:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.35,0:08:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,According to this card, a star\Nchip's proof that one is a duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.21,0:08:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that may be, but all\Nparticipants are given two star chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be at a disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.97,0:08:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.05,0:08:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'd rather take that\Nrisk than be without
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.49,0:08:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,my friend when we get\Nto the duelist kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.77,0:08:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.99,0:08:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.07,0:08:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:08:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.76,0:09:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, we've got a problem, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.37,0:09:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.37,0:09:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.28,0:09:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you shush me, Tristan! Pipe down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.77,0:09:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad they let you on board, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.25,0:09:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Only because you sacrificed\None of your star chips for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But if any of the other players find\Nout we only have one star chip each,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.67,0:09:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,they could really try\Nto take advantage of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.51,0:09:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then be quiet about it. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.99,0:09:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of exciting, isn't it, Yugi? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.07,0:09:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do we have here? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.13,0:09:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're the Yugi kid\Neverybody's talking about, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.19,0:09:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.57,0:09:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm amazed that a squirt\Nlike you could beat Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.69,0:10:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're famous, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.35,0:10:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks very much, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.27,0:10:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, miss, I'm a really good friend of\Nthe famous Yugi, the master duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.41,0:10:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.63,0:10:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you're either a champ or a chump.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut this guy loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.19,0:10:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fashion-challenged and\Ndeserves to be crushed in the games.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.77,0:10:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Please crush me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.01,0:10:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you all eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.19,0:10:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.09,0:10:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How arrogant there's nobody better\Nat playing dual monsters than Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.41,0:10:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet, they'll hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.97,0:10:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.11,0:10:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still the best
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a joke or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.31,0:10:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a luxury cruiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.17,0:10:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you've got better room somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.95,0:10:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We cut you a break and now\Nyou're causing more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.57,0:10:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to get thrown out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.15,0:10:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, aren't you that kid Yugi? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.81,0:10:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and you're weevil and\NRex the dino duelist Heh,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.27,0:10:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,you're wasting your time with those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.99,0:10:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The private rooms only go to finalists\Nfrom the last championship, like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.85,0:11:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on winning\Nthe regionals, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.35,0:11:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.57,0:11:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I went easy on him that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.91,0:11:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.82,0:11:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this time, Yugi and I\Nare gonna take the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.49,0:11:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.40,0:11:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.71,0:11:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,winning the last championship didn't\Nfeel like that much of an achievement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.61,0:11:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I can't really\Ncall myself a champion
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.79,0:11:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,until I defeat the duelist who beat Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.85,0:11:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.76,0:11:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure I'll end up battling\Nyou in the big tournament, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.17,0:11:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.97,0:11:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I look forward to it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.83,0:11:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to\Nsome dino demolition.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.87,0:11:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you a little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.93,0:11:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's something none of the other\Nplayers know about the games yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, isn't that cheating?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.85,0:11:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The other duelists will\Nfind out soon enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.37,0:11:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but there are new rules on the\Nisland that require more strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.53,0:11:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Rules are for wimps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.17,0:11:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,In dueling, you either smash your\Nopponent or get smashed yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.83,0:11:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one or the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.09,0:11:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Strength is good, but you also need to\Ncombine them with other types of cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.01,0:11:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who asked you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.15,0:12:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of my way, or I'll\Nstomp you like everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.75,0:12:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see who stomps who when we\Nget to the island. Ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.79,0:12:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's scoop up the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.43,0:12:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.59,0:12:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out those jumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.45,0:12:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They're already trading over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.67,0:12:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,players here are swapping cards\Nand strengthening their decks
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.79,0:12:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,getting ready for the big\Ntournament it's also a good chance
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.99,0:12:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,to get a feel for your\Nopponent's cards oh i bet this is
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.47,0:12:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,how we will get so much insight\Ninto his opponent's strategy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.17,0:12:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,whoa strong cards hey want to\Ntrade how about you anybody
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.69,0:12:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me out here. Guess Joey's\Ntrading if you've come all
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.71,0:12:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,this way and you're still trying\Nto improve your deck you've
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.27,0:12:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,got to be pretty desperate\Ni'll catch you on the flip side
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.15,0:12:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is truly, truly outrageous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.51,0:12:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You expect a lady like me to stay\Nin this dump without even a shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.13,0:12:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Rules are rules, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.43,0:12:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.49,0:12:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Call your superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him on the phone right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.81,0:12:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep acting up and they'll\Nthrow you off the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.31,0:12:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.87,0:12:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A champion with a luxury room. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.27,0:13:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.91,0:13:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.07,0:13:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.49,0:13:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Taya, stay down or we're busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's freezing out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't sit still.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.11,0:13:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,In another few hours, the sun will rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.79,0:13:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not funny, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.73,0:13:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.93,0:13:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Bakura? Bakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.19,0:13:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean Bakura from school?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.01,0:13:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think he's doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.81,0:13:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I guess he's in the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.33,0:13:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think of my cool digs?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.77,0:13:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.93,0:13:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be quite a strong card player.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.39,0:13:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.35,0:13:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.26,0:13:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I love duel monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we play a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.51,0:13:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.43,0:13:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you could beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.53,0:13:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:13:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd never win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.89,0:14:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell you what, if you\Nwin, I'll give you a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.39,0:14:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I got some good card trading in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.83,0:14:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let me see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.61,0:14:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamandra and a kunai with chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.83,0:14:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby dragon and shield and sword? Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.21,0:14:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,With these new magic cards\Ncombined with your monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have a real strong deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.97,0:14:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, so now I'm ready\Nto win every duel I play.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.55,0:14:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're going to find it's\Na bit harder than that, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, add this to your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It can be helpful in a tight spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.67,0:14:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.25,0:14:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get over how you're\Nalways helping me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.41,0:14:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, we need to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.35,0:14:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.25,0:14:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Ben, cut the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.37,0:14:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Playing with your deck, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.85,0:14:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll be a snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.65,0:14:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What if you win?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If I win, you agree to clear out of the\Nroom for the rest of the trip, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.31,0:14:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.27,0:14:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.07,0:15:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.98,0:15:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The first card is Shadow of Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.33,0:15:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The second card is Harpy's Lady, then\NElegant Egotist, followed by Cyber Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.85,0:15:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.09,0:15:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.35,0:15:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my own card technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.35,0:15:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I always know what cards I have and\Ncan pick anyone I like at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.93,0:15:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So, go ahead and deal them, Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.55,0:15:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think I'm in trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.19,0:15:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the evening winds sure feel nice So did\Nyou trade for any good cards, Yugi? Nah,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.45,0:15:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna duel with the cards I\Nbrought along with me I figured
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.83,0:15:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,As much. You used the Exodia cards\Nin your duel with Kaiba, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.43,0:15:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the strongest\Ncards of them all And really
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.27,0:15:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,rare Could I possibly see\Nthose legendary cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.65,0:15:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see why not Just\Nbe careful with them, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.93,0:16:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.01,0:16:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So these are the cards to summon Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.31,0:16:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,For a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.47,0:16:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been trying to come up with some kind\Nof strategy to finally beat these cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.77,0:16:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't come up with anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.99,0:16:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Until just this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.01,0:16:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to Exodia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.33,0:16:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.55,0:16:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's no one who can challenge me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.49,0:16:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.65,0:16:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.03,0:16:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were the Exodia cards that\Nmy grandpa gave me! I'll get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.49,0:16:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.27,0:16:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.25,0:16:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you, I'll get them, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.11,0:16:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, they're not worth drowning over!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.55,0:16:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.83,0:16:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there, I got one of them. Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.19,0:17:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Swim back to the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.43,0:17:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.53,0:17:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,At least this time there's something\NI can do to help someone I care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.97,0:17:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The current sure is strong, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.97,0:17:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I punk out now, who's\Ngonna help my sister, Serenity?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.33,0:17:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just three more now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.85,0:17:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.31,0:17:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.43,0:17:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, just three more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.07,0:17:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.39,0:17:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.79,0:17:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab a hold! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.59,0:17:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya! Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.21,0:17:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out, loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.75,0:17:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks for the room, Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.47,0:18:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close. I'm sure glad you\Ntwo guys showed up. Really glad we're
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.53,0:18:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,a team we all stick together we'll\Nalways watch your back thanks a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.53,0:18:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,you guys i'm sorry yugi huh i failed\Ni only found two of your guards it's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.27,0:18:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,okay joey it's not okay it's always\Nthis way with me i'm never able to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,help anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.66,0:18:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even my own sister, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.13,0:18:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.63,0:18:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a sister, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Our parents divorced years\Nago, when we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.21,0:18:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,She lives far away, with my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.39,0:18:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My sisters had really bad\Neyes since she was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.41,0:18:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Eventually, she'll go blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.47,0:18:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.19,0:18:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.10,0:18:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.01,0:18:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She sent me a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.93,0:18:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping to see you one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.01,0:18:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The doctors told her\Nthat the time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.61,0:18:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon her eyes will be impossible\Nto repair, even with surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.81,0:19:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are specialists who could perform\Nan operation now before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.65,0:19:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They could save her eyesight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no way I can\Npay for the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.15,0:19:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to win for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.39,0:19:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Winning in the duelist\Nkingdom and getting the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,prize money is the only\Nway I can help Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.23,0:19:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll both do our best, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.75,0:19:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You for your sister and me for my grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.23,0:19:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.27,0:19:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.59,0:19:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.21,0:19:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Duelist Kingdom. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.01,0:19:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
